      "description": "<p><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/adata_adult_cb_fig3.h5ad.zip?download=1\">adata_adult_cb_fig3.h5ad.zip</a> -- BARseq3 adult mouse cerebellum gene-only data made to synthesize figure 3</span></p>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/adata_adult_cb_fig3_replicate.h5ad.zip?download=1\">adata_adult_cb_fig3_replicate.h5ad.zip </a></span></span><span><span><span>-- BARseq3 adult mouse cerebellum gene-only data replicate 2, used to calculate reproducibility of transcripts</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/adult_cb_raw_FOV20_FOV40_11rds%20(1)?download=1\">adult_cb_raw_FOV20_FOV40_11rds (1) </a>--</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;subsampled (FOV20 and FOV40) <a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/adata_adult_cb_fig3.h5ad.zip?download=1\">adata_adult_cb_fig3.h5ad.zip</a> raw image example data to quickly sample run the BARseq3 pipeline</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/BARseq2_Transcriptome_Barcode.tar?download=1\">BARseq2_Transcriptome_Barcode.tar</a> -- </span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>raw images for the BARseq2 transcriptome experiments</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/BARseq3_Transcriptome_Barcode.tar?download=1\">BARseq3_Transcriptome_Barcode.tar</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>--raw images for the BARseq3 transcriptome experiments</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/BARseq3_Translatome_Barcode.tar?download=1\">BARseq3_Translatome_Barcode.tar </a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>-- raw images for the BARseq3 translatome experiments</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://zenodo.org/records/19024678/files/Malat1_Pcp2.tar?download=1\">Malat1_Pcp2.tar</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>-- raw image data for the specificity experiments using the gene expression of Malat1 and Pcp2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
